    "description": {
      "value": "<blockquote><p>Become One with Tides and Storms</p></blockquote><p>Druids of the Circle of the Sea draw on the tempestuous forces of oceans and storms. Some see themselves as embodiments of nature's wrath, taking vengeance on those who despoil it; others seek mystical unity with nature by attuning themselves to the ebb and flow of the tides, following currents and waves and listening to the whispers and roars of the winds.</p><h3>Circle of the Sea Features</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>Feature</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.crLfQ7TrrHrMMBsy]{Circle of the Sea Spells}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.SGJjwGY4qBA5NfkU]{Wrath of the Sea}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.809TSiUPaWE03czB]{Aquatic Affinity}</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.AfsGiYc8qIUVk5LA]{Stormborn}</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.classes.Item.w92xbGoPaLNhrdCT]{Oceanic Gift}</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Circle of the Sea Spells</h3><table><thead><tr><th>Druid Level</th><th>Spells</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>3</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFogCloud00]{Fog Cloud}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplGustofWind]{Gust of Wind}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplRayofFrost]{Ray of Frost}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplThunderwav]{Thunderwave}</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplLightningB]{Lightning Bolt}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWaterBreat]{Water Breathing}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplControlWat]{Control Water}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplIceStorm00]{Ice Storm}</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplConjureEle]{Conjure Elemental}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplHoldMonste]{Hold Monster}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
